   "in_standard_filter": 1,
   "description": "Corrective: fix a fault. Emergency: a breakdown that needs action now. Preventive: planned on a calendar. Predictive: due by a meter reading. Condition-based: raised by an asset found in poor condition. Routine: daily or weekly rounds. Inspection: checks and audits. Statutory: legal certifications (fire, lift, boiler) - needs a certificate. Guest Room PM: a full guest-room check. Seasonal: pool opening, AC changeover. Improvement: upgrades and projects."
